  "description": "<p>Rothco's Moisture Wicking Long Sleeve Security Polo is a must-have for professionals who prioritize comfort and functionality. Crafted from 100% polyester fabric, this polo shirt is designed to keep you cool and dry throughout your shift, thanks to its advanced moisture-wicking properties. Whether you're working indoors or outdoors, this shirt will ensure you stay comfortable and focused on the task at hand. Featuring a classic 3-button collared design, this polo shirt offers a professional look while providing added functionality. The long sleeves offer extra coverage and warmth, making it suitable for cooler weather conditions. With the bold \"Security\" print across the left chest and back, this shirt ensures easy identification and adds a touch of authority to your uniform. In addition to its moisture-wicking capabilities, the polyester fabric is also durable and resistant to wrinkles, ensuring that your shirt looks sharp and professional wear after wear. The comfortable fit and breathable fabric make this polo shirt ideal for extended wear, whether you're patrolling the premises, managing events, or conducting security checks. Whether you're a security professional, law enforcement officer, or simply looking for a reliable and comfortable shirt for work, the Rothco Moisture Wicking Long Sleeve Security Polo is the perfect choice. Stay cool, dry, and focused on the job with this high-quality and functional polo shirt.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
